      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I know two other people that have recently had the same issue. Dropping two entire ranks basically overnight. Is no way to know for sure how it's done, but both people mentioned it occurred after blocking a modified client user. Either there's some in-game exploit, or it's part of a client. Definitely needs fixing before it gets more widespread.",
